   C[Clients] --> D[Geo DNS]
-  D --> G[Cache Gateway]
-  G --> N[Cache Nodes]
-  G --> M[Shard Map (Raft)]
-  N --> B[Backing Service/DB]
-  N --> X[Metrics/Tracing]
