-- **Cluster-aware sharding**: keys route deterministically to an owning shard; resharding minimizes movement.
-- **Eviction policies**: per-namespace policy selection (`LRU`, `LFU`, `TTL`, `no-evict`) with hard memory caps.
-- **Stampede protection**: prevent thundering herds on expirations and cold keys; support stale serving safely.
-- **Multi-region endpoint**: clients use one hostname; requests land in nearest region by default.
-- **Operational primitives**: stats, admin commands (drain node, rebalance, freeze writes), and safe rolling upgrades.
